  intro B X I hOk hP l Z u G _ _ Pl0 Tt F Ks _ _ _ R g c₀ s J hX j hj hJ P t r a k tl Ch₀ A ι w hCh UT ε hT bad K eW hRd heW hbT hLev htl n hn ψ hψ f v y β x κ hκ
  subst hn
